#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD9710 expect=violation domain=SUPPAE
# Rule:Description: FDA-SD9710 — the Required key QNAM is not populated.
#note "QNAM blank -> violation; the twin scenario differs only in the value of QNAM."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#expectViolationCount 1
dataset SUPPAE
col STUDYID type=Char
col RDOMAIN type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col IDVAR type=Char
col IDVARVAL type=Char
col QNAM type=Char
col QLABEL type=Char
col QVAL type=Char
---
S1      | AE      | S1-001  | AESEQ | 1        |      | Other Medically Important SAE | Y
---
